{"ref":"BDB, יִגְאָל","hw":"יִגְאָל","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יִגְאָל</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>He redeems</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  one of the spies <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:7\" href=\"/Numbers.13.7\">Nu 13:7</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  one of David’s heroes <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:36\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.36\">2 S 23:36</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  descendant of Zerubbabel <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:22\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.22\">1 Ch 3:22</a>.","next":"BDB, גָּאַל²","prev":"BDB, גְּאֻלָּה"}